title: Enable governance duplicate-detection advisory mode and adopt pm-cli 2026.7.25
description: "Enable governance.duplicate_detection_mode=advisory so agents filing items get a near-duplicate warning at create time. Bump @unbrained/pm-cli in both dependencies (^2026.7.5 -> ^2026.7.25) and devDependencies (^2026.7.22 -> ^2026.7.25). No peerDependencies. Advisory mode is non-blocking: appends likely_duplicates warning, never fails a create."
